WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.476
In much of the south,

2
00:00:01.476 --> 00:00:03.395
marrying a cousin is preferred.

3
00:00:03.395 --> 00:00:04.721
In much of the north,

4
00:00:04.721 --> 00:00:06.043
it's forbidden.

5
00:00:06.386 --> 00:00:09.476
Irawati Karve mapped kinship zones

6
00:00:09.476 --> 00:00:10.557
in 1953.

7
00:00:10.557 --> 00:00:11.568
North, south,

8
00:00:11.568 --> 00:00:13.183
central and east.

9
00:00:13.507 --> 00:00:15.380
The north prefers marrying outside

10
00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:16.155
the village,

11
00:00:16.155 --> 00:00:17.843
and bans cousin marriage.

12
00:00:17.843 --> 00:00:20.105
The south often prefers cross-cousin

13
00:00:20.105 --> 00:00:21.218
marriage.

14
00:00:21.562 --> 00:00:23.548
Households are getting smaller,

15
00:00:23.548 --> 00:00:25.405
and women's property rights are

16
00:00:25.405 --> 00:00:27.169
changing inheritance.

17
00:00:27.525 --> 00:00:28.696
Your turn.

18
00:00:28.696 --> 00:00:30.217
Who wrote it?
